otent. It needs to restore state afterward.\n\nHmm, but actually there's a subtlety about how to test the exception case cleanly. Let me think about what \"run PIBuilder.BuildPlan\" means in the Python test context.\n\nThe most robust way is:\n1. Create a temporary Go test file (or a standalone main.go in a temp dir that's part of the module) that:\n   - Imports `github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/builder`\n   - Calls `NewPIBuilder().BuildPlan(\"test requirement\", map[string]string{...})`\n   - Prints the result/error to stdout in a structured way.\n\nActually, simpler: use `go test` with a temp test file. But the temp test file needs to be in the module (internal/builder package) to access unexported things — but BuildPlan is exported, so it can be in any package within the module that imports internal/builder. Since internal packages can only be imported by code within the same module root (github.com/sunquan/rick/...), we can create a temp directory inside the repo, e.g., under `internal/` or root, with a main.go that imports the builder.\n\nActually the simplest is to write a small Go program into a temp dir INSIDE the repo (e.g., a subdirectory), run `go run`, then remove it. But `go run` of a file that imports internal/builder requires the file to be within the module `github.com/sunquan/rick`. So we can create a temp dir like `/workdir/.../rick/.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/tmp_probe/main.go`? No — that's within the repo but is it within the module? The module is `github.com/sunquan/rick` with go.mod at repo root. Any Go file within the repo directory tree is part of the module (unless it has its own go.mod). But `.rick` might have its own go.mod? Let me check.\n\nActually wait — there's `internal/cmd/.git` and nested things. Let me check if there are nested go.mod files.\n\nActually, the cleanest approach that avoids nested module issues: write a temporary `_test.go` file into `internal/builder/` package (or a new test package `internal/builder_test`), then run `go test ./internal/builder -run TestXxx -count=1`. But this also mutates the repo. However, we can create the test file, run, then delete it. And we must be careful about cleanup.\n\nAlternatively, use `go run` with a file placed in a new subdir under the repo root but outside any nested module. Let me check for nested go.mod.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The exception test is inherently about Go behavior. The prompt says the test script is Python and should implement the test method. The test method's operation for the exception case is \"调用检查返回\" (call check return) on `PIBuilder.BuildPlan`.\n\nLet me think about how this whole test suite is run. It seems there's a framework that runs `python3 task10.py` and parses the JSON. The test script should perform the checks and report pass/fail.\n\nGiven the complexity, the most reliable approach for the exception test:\n- Write a small standalone Go probe program in a temp directory INSIDE the repo module, run it with `go run`, capture output.\n- The probe program calls `builder.NewPIBuilder().BuildPlan(...)` and prints error.\n\nBut the probe program must be inside the module. Let me check if there's a simpler approach: we could add the probe as a temp file in the repo root (module root) named e.g. `probe_main.go` with `package main`. Then `go run ./probe_main.go`? No, `go run` on a single file in the module root with package main would work: `go run probe_main.go`. Actually, the repo already has `test_parser.go` at root (package main presumably). Let me check.\n\nActually, the repo root has `test_parser.go`. Let me check its package.\n\nLet me also check: is there an existing test harness pattern in the tests dir (e.g., other task test scripts) that I can reference for how they handle Go-level checks?\n\nLet me look at the existing tests directory and any sibling task test scripts.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_yTDOsItT0zUoNbUBnYBP5599","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && ls -la tests/ && echo \"---SIBLING TESTS---\" && ls -la .rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/ 2>/dev/null && echo \"---OTHER JOB TESTS---\" && find .rick/jobs -path \"*tests*\" -name \"*.py\" 2>/dev/null | head -40"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_nvRuXI0w9VgcokxxuWvF4075","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && head -5 test_parser.go && echo \"---NESTED GOMOD---\" && find . -name \"go.mod\" -not -path \"./.git/*\" 2>/dev/null && echo \"---GOMOD CONTENT---\" && cat go.mod"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1966,"output":1743,"cacheRead":40704,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1505,"totalTokens":44413,"cost":{"input":0.00085521,"output":0.0015164100000000002,"cacheRead":0.000147552,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.002519172}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786913542646,"responseId":"3e4a0df8-6768-4bce-9ef4-be59ae0db676","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_yTDOsItT0zUoNbUBnYBP5599","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 96\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug  7 19:53 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 13 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 17 03:51 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  5430 Aug  7 19:53 build_test.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4901 Aug  7 19:53 cli_integration_test.sh\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  9131 Aug  7 19:53 DAG_EXECUTOR_INTEGRATION_TEST_REPORT.md\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  7563 Aug  7 19:53 dag_executor_integration_test.sh\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug  7 19:53 dag_executor_test_job\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  9573 Aug  7 19:53 e2e_v2_test.py\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  3202 Aug  7 19:53 integration_test.sh\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 12 18:32 mock_agent\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 10004 Aug  7 19:53 test_uninstall.sh\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 13125 Aug  7 19:53 tools_integration_test.sh\n---SIBLING TESTS---\ntotal 148\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 17 04:31 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 17 00:59 ..\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 17 04:32 __pycache__\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4346 Aug 17 01:05 task1.py\n-rwxrwxr-x 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  5605 Aug 17 01:12 task2.py\n-rwxrwxr-x 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 12682 Aug 17 02:35 task3.py\n-rwxrwxr-x 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 12640 Aug 17 01:36 task4.py\n-rwxrwxr-x 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 13538 Aug 17 02:00 task5.py\n-rwxrwxr-x 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 10218 Aug 17 03:03 task6.py\n-rwxrwxr-x 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 17854 Aug 17 03:57 task7.py\n-rwxrwxr-x 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 22345 Aug 17 04:32 task8.py\n-rwxrwxr-x 1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 15536 Aug 17 03:23 task9.py\n---OTHER JOB TESTS---\n.rick/jobs/job_6/doing/tests/task2.py\n.rick/jobs/job_6/doing/tests/task1.py\n.rick/jobs/job_6/doing/tests/task4.py\n.rick/jobs/job_6/doing/tests/task3.py\n.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task9.py\n.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task5.py\n.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task2.py\n.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task7.py\n.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task1.py\n.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task6.py\n.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task4.py\n.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task8.py\n.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task3.py\n.rick/jobs/job_17/doing/tests/task2.py\n.rick/jobs/job_17/doing/tests/task1.py\n.rick/jobs/job_17/doing/tests/task4.py\n.rick/jobs/job_17/doing/tests/task3.py\n.rick/jobs/job_16/doing/tests/task2.py\n.rick/jobs/job_16/doing/tests/task1.py\n.rick/jobs/job_16/doing/tests/task4.py\n.rick/jobs/job_16/doing/tests/task3.py\n.rick/jobs/job_11/doing/tests/task2.py\n.rick/jobs/job_11/doing/tests/task1.py\n.rick/jobs/job_11/doing/tests/task3.py\n.rick/jobs/job_5/doing/tests/task5.py\n.rick/jobs/job_5/doing/tests/task2.py\n.rick/jobs/job_5/doing/tests/task7.py\n.rick/jobs/job_5/doing/tests/task1.py\n.rick/jobs/job_5/doing/tests/task6.py\n.rick/jobs/job_5/doing/tests/task4.py\n.rick/jobs/job_5/doing/tests/task3.py\n.rick/jobs/job_12/doing/tests/task2.py\n.rick/jobs/job_12/doing/tests/task1.py\n.rick/jobs/job_12/doing/tests/task4.py\n.rick/jobs/job_12/doing/tests/task3.py\n.rick/jobs/job_14/doing/tests/task9.py\n.rick/jobs/job_14/doing/tests/task5.py\n.rick/jobs/job_14/doing/tests/task2.py\n.rick/jobs/job_14/doing/tests/task7.py\n.rick/jobs/job_14/doing/tests/task1.py\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786913563138},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_nvRuXI0w9VgcokxxuWvF4075","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"package main\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"io/ioutil\"\n---NESTED GOMOD---\n./go.mod\n---GOMOD CONTENT---\nmodule github.com/sunquan/rick\n\ngo 1.25.0\n\nrequire (\n\tgithub.com/spf13/cobra v1.10.2\n\tgithub.com/yuin/goldmark v1.7.16\n)\n\nrequire (\n\tgithub.com/inconshreveable/mousetrap v1.1.0 // indirect\n\tgithub.com/spf13/pflag v1.0.9 // indirect\n)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786913563138},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me look at a sibling task test script (e.g., task9.py, task8.py) to understand the patterns used, especially how they handle Go-level checks (if any).","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_vRNqnPGxKsvxfdNUUWKf8033","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task9.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1760,"output":111,"cacheRead":44288,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":38,"totalTokens":46159,"cost":{"input":0.0007656000000000001,"output":0.00009657,"cacheRead":0.000160544,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.001022714}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786913563139,"responseId":"46cd3200-1ffc-4759-a7f2-1065c074df54","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_vRNqnPGxKsvxfdNUUWKf8033","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"task9 验收测试：注册 think/research/exporter 为 pi 自定义 agent（经 env 职责 3 落盘）。\n\n按 skill:tdd 四要素（前置条件/输入/操作/预期）实现测试方法三类断言，断言真实落盘文件、\n不 mock：用一个临时 Go 程序直接调用真实的 `env.DeployRickCustomizations()`（隔离\nRICK_PI_AGENT_DIR 指向 temp、程序内 chdir 到仓库根使 `.rick/skills` 源可见）。\n\n1. 正常路径：前置=task3/5 完成 + RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR 指向 temp；输入=运行 DeployRickCustomizations；\n   操作=运行 + `test -f agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` + 解析 agents/ 下 frontmatter 的\n   `name` 字段（等价于 pi 真实发现入口 `{action:\"list\"}` 所列 agent 名）；预期=3 文件存在、\n   `head -5 think.md` 含 `name: think`、发现清单 = {think,research,exporter}，且 frontmatter 含\n   name/description/tools/defaultContext + rick-managed: true 标记、tools 对齐 pi 工具名。\n\n2. 边界（幂等 + 覆盖语义）：前置=已注册一次；输入=再次运行；操作=再次运行 + sha256 对比前后；\n   预期=内容不变（幂等）；另预置无 rick-managed: true 的同名文件 → 运行后不被覆盖（仅覆盖有\n   标记的文件）；反向预置含 rick-managed: true 的陈旧文件 → 运行后被覆盖为最新 wiki 正文。\n\n3. 异常（system prompt 非空）：前置=3 文件已写；输入=无；操作=解析 frontmatter 闭合后的正文，\n   等价 `awk '/^---$/{n++} n>=2 && /[^[:space:]]/{print}'` 统计非空行；预期=每文件 ≥1 且含\n   对应 skill wiki 标记（skill:think / skill:research / skill:exporter）。\n\n脚本只读代码 + 跑 go run 临时程序 + go test ./internal/env/...，产物落临时目录，幂等；\n仅向 stdout 输出一行 JSON。\n\"\"\"\nimport hashlib\nimport json\nimport os\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport tempfile\n\n\n# 3 个 agent 的期望规格：key = agent 名（也是文件名 {key}.md）。\nAGENTS = {\n    'think': {\n        'tools': ['read', 'grep', 'find', 'ls'],\n        'skill_marker': 'skill:think',\n    },\n    'research': {\n        'tools': ['read', 'grep', 'find', 'ls', 'bash', 'web_search', 'fetch_content'],\n        'skill_marker': 'skill:research',\n    },\n    'exporter': {\n        'tools': ['read', 'write', 'bash'],\n        'skill_marker': 'skill:exporter',\n    },\n}\n\n\n# 临时 Go 程序：真实调用 env.DeployRickCustomizations()。第一个参数为运行期 cwd\n# （chdir 后 workspace.GetRickDir() 才能定位到仓库的 .rick/skills 源目录，与 init-pi\n# 从仓库根运行一致）。\n_DEPLOY_GO = '''package main\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"os\"\n\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/env\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n\ttarget := \".\"\n\tif len(os.Args) > 1 {\n\t\ttarget = os.Args[1]\n\t}\n\tif err := os.Chdir(target); err != nil {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"chdir %s failed: %v\\\\n\", target, err)\n\t\tos.Exit(2)\n\t}\n\tif err := env.DeployRickCustomizations(); err != nil {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"deploy failed: %v\\\\n\", err)\n\t\tos.Exit(1)\n\t}\n\tfmt.Println(\"deploy-ok\")\n}\n'''\n\n\ndef find_repo_root(start_file):\n    \"\"\"定位仓库根目录（绝对路径）。\n\n    优先向上查找 .git 标记；若不存在则回退到脚本相对路径：\n    脚本位于 <root>/.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task9.py，向上 5 层即仓库根。\n    \"\"\"\n    d = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(start_file))\n    probe = d\n    while True:\n        if os.path.isdir(os.path.join(probe, '.git')):\n            return probe\n        parent = os.path.dirname(probe)\n        if parent == probe:\n            break\n        probe = parent\n    for _ in range(5):\n        d = os.path.dirname(d)\n    return d\n\n\ndef run(cmd, cwd, timeout=300, env=None):\n    \"\"\"运行子进程，返回 (returncode, stdout, stderr)。\"\"\"\n    try:\n        p = subprocess.run(\n            cmd, cwd=cwd, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=timeout, env=env\n        )\n        return p.returncode, p.stdout, p.stderr\n    except FileNotFoundError as e:\n        return 127, '', str(e)\n    except subprocess.TimeoutExpired as e:\n        out = e.stdout or ''\n        err = (e.stderr or '') + '\\n[timeout after %ds]' % timeout\n        return 124, out, err\n\n\ndef tail(text, n=1600):\n    \"\"\"截取文本尾部，用于错误信息（避免刷屏）。\"\"\"\n    if not text:\n        return ''\n    return text[-n:]\n\n\ndef read_text(path):\n    \"\"\"读取文本文件内容，失败返回 None。\"\"\"\n    try:\n        with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            return f.read()\n    except Exception:\n        return None\n\n\ndef write_file(path, content):\n    \"\"\"写文件并自动创建父目录。\"\"\"\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write(content)\n\n\ndef sha256_file(path):\n    \"\"\"计算文件 sha256（十六进制），失败返回 None。\"\"\"\n    h = hashlib.sha256()\n    try:\n        with open(path, 'rb') as f:\n            for chunk in iter(lambda: f.read(65536), b''):\n                h.update(chunk)\n        return h.hexdigest()\n    except Exception:\n        return None\n\n\ndef parse_frontmatter(content):\n    \"\"\"解析 agent 文件，返回 (frontmatter dict, body 字符串, error)。\n\n    frontmatter 由首行 `---` 与随后的第一个 `---` 行闭合；body 为闭合之后全部内容。\n    （skill wiki 正文内部出现的 `---` 水平线属于 body，不影响解析。）\n    \"\"\"\n    if content is None:\n        return None, None, 'file not readable'\n    lines = content.split('\\n')\n    if not lines or lines[0].strip() != '---':\n        return None, None, 'missing opening ---'\n    end = None\n    for i in range(1, len(lines)):\n        if lines[i].strip() == '---':\n            end = i\n            break\n    if end is None:\n        return None, None, 'missing closing ---'\n    fm = {}\n    for ln in lines[1:end]:\n        ln = ln.strip()\n        if not ln or ln.startswith('#'):\n            continue\n        if ':' in ln:\n            k, v = ln.split(':', 1)\n            fm[k.strip()] = v.strip()\n    body = '\\n'.join(lines[end + 1:])\n    return fm, body, None\n\n\ndef count_body_nonblank(body):\n    \"\"\"等价 awk '/^---$/{n++} n>=2 && /[^[:space:]]/{print}' 的非空正文行数。\"\"\"\n    if not body:\n        return 0\n    return sum(1 for ln in body.split('\\n') if ln.strip())\n\n\ndef discover_agent_names(agents_dir):\n    \"\"\"从 agents 目录解析各 .md 的 frontmatter name 字段（等价于 pi {action:\"list\"} 列名）。\"\"\"\n    names = set()\n    if not os.path.isdir(agents_dir):\n        return names\n    for fn in sorted(os.listdir(agents_dir)):\n        if not fn.endswith('.md'):\n            continue\n        content = read_text(os.path.join(agents_dir, fn))\n        fm, _, err = parse_frontmatter(content)\n        if err is None and fm.get('name'):\n            names.add(fm['name'])\n    return names\n\n\ndef write_deploy_program(repo_root):\n    \"\"\"在仓库根下建一个 `.tmp_task9_*` 目录写入临时 Go 程序，返回该目录路径。\n\n    `.` 前缀目录不会被 `go build ./...` / `go test ./...` 拾取；位于模块内方可导入\n    internal 包。运行期 cwd 由程序参数控制（见 _DEPLOY_GO）。\n    \"\"\"\n    tmpdir = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='.tmp_task9_deploy_', dir=repo_root)\n    write_file(os.path.join(tmpdir, 'main.go'), _DEPLOY_GO)\n    return tmpdir\n\n\ndef run_deploy(go, prog_dir, target_cwd, agent_dir, home):\n    \"\"\"运行临时 Go 程序调用 DeployRickCustomizations，返回 (rc, out, err)。\"\"\"\n    env = os.environ.copy()\n    env['RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR'] = agent_dir\n    env['HOME'] = home\n    return run([go, 'run', '.', target_cwd], cwd=prog_dir, timeout=240, env=env)\n\n\ndef main():\n    errors = []\n\n    repo_root = find_repo_root(__file__)\n    go = shutil.which('go')\n    if not go:\n        result = {'pass': False, 'errors': ['go toolchain not found in PATH']}\n        print(json.dumps(result))\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    prog_dir = write_deploy_program(repo_root)\n\n    # ================= 正常路径 =================\n    agent_dir = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_agent_')\n    home = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_home_')\n    rc, out, err = run_deploy(go, prog_dir, repo_root, agent_dir, home)\n    if rc != 0:\n        errors.append('DeployRickCustomizations (正常路径) exit=%d:\\n%s' % (rc, tail(err or out)))\n    else:\n        # 3 文件存在 + frontmatter 字段校验。\n        for name in AGENTS:\n            p = os.path.join(agent_dir, 'agents', name + '.md')\n            if not os.path.isfile(p):\n                errors.append('%s.md 未落盘: %s' % (name, p))\n                continue\n            content = read_text(p)\n            fm, body, ferr = parse_frontmatter(content)\n            if ferr:\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter 解析失败: %s' % (name, ferr))\n                continue\n            if fm.get('name') != name:\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter name=%r, want %r' % (name, fm.get('name'), name))\n            got_tools = sorted(t.strip() for t in fm.get('tools', '').split(',') if t.strip())\n            want_tools = sorted(AGENTS[name]['tools'])\n            if got_tools != want_tools:\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter tools=%r, want %r' % (name, got_tools, want_tools))\n            if not fm.get('description'):\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter 缺非空 description' % name)\n            if not fm.get('defaultContext'):\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter 缺非空 defaultContext' % name)\n            if fm.get('rick-managed') != 'true':\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter 缺 rick-managed: true 标记' % name)\n\n        # `head -5 think.md` 含 `name: think`。\n        think_path = os.path.join(agent_dir, 'agents', 'think.md')\n        think_content = read_text(think_path)\n        if think_content is None:\n            errors.append('think.md 无法读取（head -5 检查）')\n        else:\n            head5 = '\\n'.join(think_content.split('\\n')[:5])\n            if 'name: think' not in head5:\n                errors.append('head -5 think.md 不含 `name: think`')\n\n        # 真实发现入口（等价：agents/ 下 frontmatter name 字段集合）。\n        discovered = discover_agent_names(os.path.join(agent_dir, 'agents'))\n        if discovered != set(AGENTS.keys()):\n            errors.append('agent 发现清单 = %s, want %s'\n                          % (sorted(discovered), sorted(AGENTS.keys())))\n\n        # ================= 边界：幂等 =================\n        before = {}\n        for name in AGENTS:\n            p = os.path.join(agent_dir, 'agents', name + '.md')\n            if os.path.isfile(p):\n                before[name] = sha256_file(p)\n        rc2, out2, err2 = run_deploy(go, prog_dir, repo_root, agent_dir, home)\n        if rc2 != 0:\n            errors.append('DeployRickCustomizations (幂等重跑) exit=%d:\\n%s' % (rc2, tail(err2 or out2)))\n        else:\n            changed = [